WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.810
Chara-su!

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.900
Hi! Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.730
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.320
The next thirty minutes is chock full of shugo-cute anime!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:11.940
It'll be the most fun you'll have all day!

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.460
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.120
Unlock!

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.700
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.010
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.880
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.730
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.610
you're like a dream.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.460
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.350
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.190
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:37.990
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:41.790
Whenever I start something new

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.500
I get really excited,

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.170
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.310
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:54.280
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.740
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:07.870
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.490
It's party time!

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:16.240
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:19.980
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:24.180
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.390
It's party time!

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:31.100
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.610
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:39.240
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.030
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.310
Hiyas, my little Eggs!

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:48.250
Which anime's up first on Shugo Chara Party today?

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.000
The one starring the Guardian Characters!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.750
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.340
Those Guardian Characters sure are...

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:54.760
...shugo-cute!

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:57.930
Yep! And Ran, Miki, and Su are at it again!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.190
Check it out!

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.940
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:09.580
"Kiseki's Crown!"

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:18.080
My... My crown has disappeared!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:22.500
How could I have allowed my crown to be filched?!

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.920
Sounds bad...

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.410
So someone stole it?

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.960
Yes! I suspect someone must have coveted my glorious, shining crown.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.830
Uh, I highly doubt that.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:34.900
I certainly am not interested in it.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.340
Now that I look at him, something definitely feels off.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.170
He's barely half a king now.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.400
He looks a bit silly.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.980
I know! Let's make him a new crown!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.000
Ooh, that sounds fun!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.940
I would be pleased to help out!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.910
Gotta make it gorgeous, right?

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.710
Gorgeous is great, but it lacks a kingly quality.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.990
Then, how about this one?

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.300
Way too normal.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:12.160
It may look normal on the outside, but it has many hidden features.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.990
Like a fan to cool you down.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.740
A back scratcher for those hard to reach places.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.630
And cold beverages for when you're parched!

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:25.930
It's too heavy!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:29.030
And what of a king's dignity?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.800
None of you get it, do you?

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:35.450
A majestic, dignified crown looks something like this!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:42.190
Splendid! With this new crown on my head, the masses will prostrate themselves before me!

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:43.820
But something's still off.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:47.910
I've got it! Your western-style outfit doesn't match.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:49.540
So true.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.490
All right, people, it's makeover time!

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.260
Awesome!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.300
What are you doing to me?!

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.660
C-Cool, isn't it?

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.720
Y-Yeah!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:06.920
D-Desu!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.800
You really think so?

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.140
Kiseki-tan!

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:16.510
You dropped your crown back there.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.020
Whoa. Lame.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.910
You rascals!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:25.430
Halt! Do not flee!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.000
I can't make it stop!

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.950
See you again!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.930
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:37.670
The first Character we'll introduce is... Rhythm!

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:45.800
Rhythm is Nagihiko's Guardian Character, who's the Jack's Chair. He dresses like a rapper.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.580
His "just do it" attitude makes him a pretty impulsive guy.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.660
He was born from something lacking from Nagihiko's overly prudent nature.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.140
He's always so full of energy!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:10.530
Continuing on, the second Character is... Temari!

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:18.190
She's Nadeshiko's Guardian Character, who used to be the Queen's Chair. She wears a long-sleeved kimono.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:20.380
She's always so ladylike!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.690
But she's pretty scary when she snaps.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:30.700
Though Amu-chan hasn't realized it yet, Nadeshiko and Nagihiko are actually the same person.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.560
But you all knew that already!

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:36.530
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:37.870
Look forward to it!

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:43.510
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:47.320
Today we'll play the "Chopsticks Master!" quiz game! It looks awesome!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.120
Once you've solved the quiz, use your chopsticks to transfer the eggs!

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:54.700
When you're done with that, you can answer the question!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.510
Okay, here's the question:

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.950
Who was Amu-chan's third Guardian Character to be born?

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.640
We know!

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.790
Good luck, girls!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:06.400
Are you good with chopsticks?

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.870
Heart's left-handed, huh?

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.650
Oh, Spade's got one!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.880
Clover got one, too!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:18.500
All three of you are doin' great!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.270
Oh no, it slipped!

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.980
Go pick it up!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:26.410
Who will survive this three-person battle?

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.550
It's so close!

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:31.480
And now Heart has three finished!

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:33.870
One more to go!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.870
I got it! I'm done!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.580
Okay, Heart, what's the answer?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.610
Su!

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:43.310
Correct! Su was Amu-chan's third Guardian Character to be born!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:48.490
Today's winner was Amulet Heart! Do your best next week!

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.660
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.920
"Shugo Bomber - Part 2!"

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:06.430
Egg Warriors - Shugo Bomber!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:11.990
The secret to Bomber Robo 421 is now unveiled!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.270
Why are you holding that, Dia?

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.690
You know, I can't believe we're actually continuing this.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.990
Bombger!

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:23.910
She's back...

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.170
Must we do this, Su?

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.420
Do not call me Su! I am The Commissioner!

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:35.340
Look, I understand you want to help us power-up so we can combat the X Eggs, but...

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:37.060
These outfits are kind of...

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.320
So, what's on the agenda today?

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.930
Bombger!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.850
What's that?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.060
A catchphrase I created!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:51.150
By combining the "bomber" in Shugo Bomber with the word "roger" in english, you get "bombger!"

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.850
For example: "Move out, Shugo Bomber!"

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.780
"Bombger!"

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.530
You can use it like that.

00:07:58.530 --> 00:07:59.940
That's perfect!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:04.240
Of course! And I'll gather more research material each week!

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.570
Uh, there is seriously something wrong with you.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:11.300
To answer your question, today we'll practice using "bombger!"

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.070
No way! It's so lame!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.740
I'm never saying something like that, ever.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:23.280
But I've been wracking my brain to help us all...

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:26.640
I'm simply trying to do my very best!

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:33.280
Don't cry! I watched you build this secret base from inside my egg.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.780
She watched?

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.520
So she didn't help at all?

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.070
Dia!

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.990
Commissioner!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.400
Bombger!

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.790
Sorry, I guess I went too far.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.080
You've really done a lot for us, I guess...

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:49.350
So will you say "bombger" for me, then?

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:52.180
Will you say it?!

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.640
All together now!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.090
Bombger!

00:08:58.090 --> 00:08:59.890
B-Bombger!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.060
Bombger!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.020
B-Bombger!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.500
And thus, the bonds between the allies were fortified!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.190
But the evil ambitions of the X Egg Empire continue unabated!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.190
Ever vigilant, Shugo Bomber must stand!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.460
Fight, Shugo Bomber!

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:16.320
There's gonna be <i>more</i>?!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:18.230
Bombger!

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.230
See you again!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:24.710
Coming up next is Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.510
Today's episode is titled "Hikaru vs. Bunny?"

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:29.170
His first job sounds tough!

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.300
So it's about Hikaru and a bunny?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.540
And they're going to fight?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:55.100
What's really important?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:01.150
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:08.410
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:19.750
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:24.470
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.840
They're all precious things.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:33.010
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:34.540
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:37.600
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:41.030
you're not alone.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:43.190
We'll always be together.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.830
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.860
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:52.040
Open Heart, now!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.700
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:58.710
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:04.550
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:06.770
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.620
Taking care of animals?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:17.980
There's a vacancy on the animal committee, so we have to find a replacement.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.880
And you want me to?

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:22.350
This sort of thing is also part of a Guardian's job.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.840
It's like you're hired help...

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.200
I guess it seems that way...

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:30.740
But taking care of animals is a fun job.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.170
You think?

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.300
Yes.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:35.040
Although it can be difficult, too.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:38.250
Hey, what are your favorite animals, Hikaru-kun?

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.040
My favorites?

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:44.820
Pork, beef, and poultry. Those are the only ones I've eaten.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:47.340
E-Eaten,  huh?

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:51.430
Come on, haven't you ever thought dogs and cats were cute?

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:52.710
No.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:58.900
I'm sure you'll come to think of the animals you'll be looking after as cute.

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:09.330
This is the little guy you'll be taking care of.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.510
So cute!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.960
This is...

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:20.380
Phylum Chordata, Subphylum Vertebrata, Class Mammalia.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.250
Order Lagomorpha, Family Leporidae.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.810
You can just call it a rabbit, you know.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.140
First, you've gotta feed it!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:31.530
Wait... What do rabbits eat?

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.640
You don't know?

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.170
N-No... It's not like I have one...

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:39.320
Rabbits eat grass, and you can also give them pellets.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.900
You should also supplement their diet with vegetables.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.850
Hikaru-kun's so knowledgeable!

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:47.030
Unlike Amu-chan.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:50.200
Let's try giving it some food!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.850
Don't worry, it's tame.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.210
Are you okay?

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.510
Liar.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.010
It's violent.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.560
T-That's not true!

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:15.250
Rabbits are timid, so they're wary of strangers.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.360
It'll get used to you as you earn its trust.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.560
Next is cleaning the cage!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:29.580
Leave the cleaning to me!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.030
All right.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:34.720
You there, Red, clean up the droppings.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:36.850
Blue, give it fresh water.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:37.730
Why me?!

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:41.000
Yellow, put the rabbit in that cage over there.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.820
You told me to leave it to you guys.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.590
Hikaru-kun.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.970
This is your job.

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:58.840
To hold a rabbit, grab the scruff of its neck,

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:02.140
and hold it close against your stomach.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.820
Wait!

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.740
This is annoying.

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:14.400
Taking care of animals isn't fun at all.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:17.620
It'll happen, little by little.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:21.320
Just try to find the fun in it as you go.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:24.770
I finally caught it!

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.350
All clean!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.170
The rabbit looks glad, too.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:03.530
What wrong? Is it hungry?

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:05.920
It wants to play with you, Hikaru-kun!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.320
And it wants you to hold it!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:23.580
Rabbits need exercise.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.320
If possible, they should be walked daily.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.030
Hey, wait!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:32.660
Don't go into the flower beds!

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.520
Hey, you!

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:40.110
Don't trample the flowers!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.730
Sorry... and thanks.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.250
You're workin' hard, huh?

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.940
I'm only doing it because it's part of my job.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.940
You're so not cute!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.380
Working by yourself? That's not fair.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.510
I'm really good with animals!

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:12.610
You have pets?

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:14.080
Pets?

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.380
Would those be considered pets?

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.580
Wait, are they even alive?

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.380
I've got to get back now.

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:23.430
Let's go.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:25.100
Huh?

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:30.270
It looks kinda sick.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.290
What's the matter?

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:44.020
Rabbits do not eat much, but may occasionally ingest things it should not.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:49.490
Maybe it ate some of the flowers earlier?

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:51.780
It says its tummy hurts.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.440
What should we do?

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.620
I don't believe the flowers are particularly toxic.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.070
With enough rest-

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:00.160
I know!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.330
Let's get medicine from the nurse's office!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.380
Human medicine is no good!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:05.960
Shall I cook some porridge?

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.110
Rabbits can't eat rice!

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:09.210
What about eggnog?

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.920
Definitely not!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.830
At times like this...

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:16.130
Ah, that's it!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:22.930
Rikka-chan?

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.530
When I was a little girl...

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:32.650
Whenever I had a bad fever, my mom would stroke my back like this.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:35.610
And it'd make me feel better.

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:40.570
My mom's warm hand felt so nice.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.420
Hikaru-kun's parents...

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:47.540
...died in an accident.

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:57.600
Porridge might not work,

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.820
but something soft would be fine.

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:02.550
We'll puree its food so it can drink it.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:06.070
Yeah! Let's try that!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.190
Yay, it took it!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:14.570
Yeah.

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:19.910
Keep it up! You're like this bunny's mom now, got it?

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.810
Its mother?

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.870
Hikaru-sama, it's time to go home.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:36.310
Please get in.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.210
No.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:40.680
I'm staying here.

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:43.990
Now, we can't have that.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.230
It is time for students to go home.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.690
You have to follow the rules, you know.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:54.950
But what about my job to take care of the animals?

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.590
I can't let you stay here overnight.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:04.070
Don't worry. I've arranged for a vet to look after him.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:11.250
Why do people desire and adore these troublesome, annoying things?

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:12.680
Quite the mystery, isn't it?

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:17.740
It takes a lot of work to care for such tiny creatures.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.380
It's irrational.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.930
Yes.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:26.250
But you can't help but fall in love with them.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.930
And those little ones have a strength of their own.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:36.490
Dogs, cats, rabbits, and even human children.

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:40.940
I think you know that quite well.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.380
Don't you fret.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.530
All right!

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:16.550
Hikaru-kun! Rikka!

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.870
The rabbit's all better!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:24.020
Thank heavens!

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:26.240
What is it, Hikaru-kun?

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:28.660
Do you feel okay?

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.720
I'm fine... Though I feel a bit strange.

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:38.740
There's this warmth in my chest...

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.420
Why is that?

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:49.260
Maybe it's that you've grown to love the rabbit.

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.800
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:16.420
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:20.900
Which egg is the lucky one?

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:27.210
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:30.700
First, for those who chose Su:

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:31.640
You get four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:32.970
Super Lucky!

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:37.390
Coordinate accessories with your friends and you'll be braver than ever!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.290
Dia's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:42.770
Don't forget to check your mail!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:42.860
You'll get an encouraging message from a friend!

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.490
Ran's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:47.150
Beating video games is easy when you work together!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:47.480
If you play video games with your friends, you get along better!

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:50.160
Finally, for those who chose Miki's egg:

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.540
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.840
You might accidentally hurt a friend because of something you say.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:58.190
Be careful!

00:21:58.190 --> 00:22:00.760
Your lucky item is a Character sticker!

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:03.170
Apologize before it turns into a disagreement!

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:08.920
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Audition Report!

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:18.140
Thank you so much for all your applications to be the fourth member of Shugo Chara Egg!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:23.230
Look at how many we got from all over Japan!

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:26.790
Next time, we'll fill you all in on the judging process!

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:29.120
Look forward to it, 'kay?

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:32.990
Hooray!

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:35.080
I want to meet Diamond soon!

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:37.120
I wonder who'll be picked?

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:40.760
Be who you want to be, and do your best!

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:43.220
See you next week for another episode of Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:46.550
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:48.940
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
